- LongCat-Video-Avatar 1.6 by the Meituan LongCat team, MIT: https://huggingface.co/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.6
- the same as single ComfyUI files (bf16, int8 ConvRot, W6A8, W4A8, the two LoRAs, the Whisper large-v3 encoder):
